{"id": "23a5627e-7017-469d-b698-081d5a04a6fc", "slug": "synthetica-decoding-cognition-1", "title": "Synthetica - Decoding Cognition", "description": "Synthetica Decoding Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Synthetica - Decoding Cognition\"\ndescription: \"Synthetica Decoding Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#67E8F9\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#7C3AED\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#0F172A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Synthetica - Decoding Cognition\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 34; favorites: 15; remixes: 0.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nSynthetica Decoding Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nsynthetica decoding human cognition\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: decoding human cognition.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #67E8F9, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #7C3AED, background #050505, surface #0F172A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Synthetica - Decoding Cognition</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-white font-sans relative w-full h-screen overflow-hidden text-base antialiased selection:bg-cyan-900 selection:text-cyan-50\">\n\n    <!-- Subtle Diagonal Background Texture -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.02] z-0\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #fff 0, #fff 1px, transparent 0, transparent 50%); background-size: 6px 6px;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Framed Container -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-3 md:inset-6 border border-white/10 flex flex-col pointer-events-none z-10 bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(255,255,255,0.02);\">\n\n        <!-- Frame Corner Brackets (L-shapes) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -left-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-white/40\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -right-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-white/40\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -left-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-white/40\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -right-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-white/40\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Frame Grid Lines -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-20 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-8 md:left-16 w-[1px] bg-white/10 hidden md:block\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"h-20 px-6 md:px-12 flex items-center justify-between pointer-events-auto relative z-20\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 opacity-0\" id=\"logo-container\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:square-double-alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-3xl text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xl tracking-tight font-medium text-white\">synthetica</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400 animate-pulse\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-300 animate-pulse delay-100\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Content Area -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 relative pointer-events-auto overflow-hidden\">\n\n            <!-- Aura Asset Background Image (Abstract Neon Wave) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-20 bg-cover bg-center mix-blend-screen\" style=\"background-image: url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/7886e3b6-d46b-45d9-9420-3c200c0c69e9_3840w.jpg');\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Canvas for Animated Data Brain -->\n            <canvas id=\"neuralCanvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-0 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- Typography / Content -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-12 left-6 md:bottom-20 md:left-24 max-w-4xl z-20\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5.5rem] font-medium tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-white\" id=\"hero-title\">\n                    <span class=\"block overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"block translate-y-full split-word font-light\">decoding</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"block overflow-hidden pb-1\"><span class=\"block translate-y-full split-word font-light\">human</span></span>\n\n                    <span class=\"block overflow-hidden mt-2 pb-2\">\n                        <span class=\"inline-block translate-y-full split-word relative group\">\n                            <!-- Gradient Border Wrapper -->\n                            <span class=\"absolute -inset-[2px] rounded-sm opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(120deg, #a855f7, #67e8f9, #a855f7); background-size: 200% 200%; animation: gradientShift 3s ease infinite;\"></span>\n\n                            <!-- Highlight Box with custom pinstripes adapted for dark mode -->\n                            <span class=\"relative inline-block px-4 py-1 text-white font-light\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0f172a 0%, #0f172a 15%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 15%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 16%, #0f172a 16%, #0f172a 84%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 84%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 85%, #0f172a 85%, #0f172a 100%);\">\n                                cognition\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <style>\n        @keyframes gradientShift {\n            0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }\n            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }\n            100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <script>\n        // GSAP Animations\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Intro Sequence\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power4.out\" } });\n\n            tl.to(\"#logo-container\", {\n                opacity: 1,\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                startAt: { y: -10 }\n            })\n            .to(\".split-word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"expo.out\"\n            }, \"-=1.2\");\n        });\n\n        // Canvas Data Brain Animation (Simulating WebGL Particle Grid)\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('neuralCanvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: false });\n        let width, height;\n        let particles = [];\n\n        const config = {\n            cellSize: 14,\n            gap: 2,\n            colors: ['#8B5CF6', '#A78BFA', '#C4B5FD', '#7C3AED', '#67E8F9', '#93C5FD'], // Purples & Cyans\n            brainOffsetX: 0.65, // Position center X (percentage)\n            brainOffsetY: 0.45, // Position center Y (percentage)\n            scale: 0.8\n        };\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            initGrid();\n        }\n\n        // Generates a shape map conceptually resembling a brain hemisphere\n        function isInsideBrainMap(x, y, cx, cy, radiusX, radiusY) {\n            // Main hemisphere\n            const dx = (x - cx) / radiusX;\n            const dy = (y - cy) / radiusY;\n            let dist = dx*dx + dy*dy;\n\n            // Add some noise/perturbation to the edges\n            const angle = Math.atan2(dy, dx);\n            const noise = Math.sin(angle * 5) * 0.15 + Math.cos(angle * 3) * 0.1;\n\n            // Brain stem area\n            const isStem = (x > cx - radiusX*0.2 && x < cx + radiusX*0.1 && y > cy && y < cy + radiusY * 1.5);\n\n            return dist + noise < 1 || isStem;\n        }\n\n        function initGrid() {\n            particles = [];\n            const cols = Math.floor(width / (config.cellSize + config.gap));\n            const rows = Math.floor(height / (config.cellSize + config.gap));\n\n            // Calculate pixel coordinates for the brain center\n            const centerX = width * config.brainOffsetX;\n            const centerY = height * config.brainOffsetY;\n\n            // Responsive radius based on screen size\n            const baseRadiusX = Math.min(width, height) * 0.4 * config.scale;\n            const baseRadiusY = Math.min(width, height) * 0.3 * config.scale;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < cols; i++) {\n                for (let j = 0; j < rows; j++) {\n                    const x = i * (config.cellSize + config.gap);\n                    const y = j * (config.cellSize + config.gap);\n\n                    if (isInsideBrainMap(x, y, centerX, centerY, baseRadiusX, baseRadiusY)) {\n                        // Randomly drop some blocks to create the porous grid look\n                        if (Math.random() > 0.15) {\n                            // Assign color with heavy bias towards purples, occasional cyan\n                            const isCyan = Math.random() > 0.92;\n                            const colorPool = isCyan ? ['#67E8F9', '#A5F3FC'] : ['#8B5CF6', '#A78BFA', '#7C3AED', '#5B21B6'];\n                            const color = colorPool[Math.floor(Math.random() * colorPool.length)];\n\n                            particles.push({\n                                x: x,\n                                y: y,\n                                baseColor: color,\n                                alpha: Math.random() * 0.8 + 0.2, // Initial random alpha\n                                targetAlpha: Math.random() * 0.8 + 0.2,\n                                pulseSpeed: Math.random() * 0.02 + 0.005,\n                                timeOffset: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\n                                rx: config.cellSize / 2 // Rounded corner radius\n                            });\n                        }\n                    } else if (Math.random() > 0.995) {\n                        // Sparse floating \"data points\" outside the main brain\n                        particles.push({\n                            x: x,\n                            y: y,\n                            baseColor: '#67E8F9',\n                            alpha: Math.random() * 0.5,\n                            pulseSpeed: 0.05,\n                            timeOffset: Math.random() * 10\n                        });\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        // Helper to draw rounded rect on canvas\n        function roundRect(ctx, x, y, width, height, radius) {\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.moveTo(x + radius, y);\n            ctx.lineTo(x + width - radius, y);\n            ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x + width, y, x + width, y + radius);\n            ctx.lineTo(x + width, y + height - radius);\n            ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x + width, y + height, x + width - radius, y + height);\n            ctx.lineTo(x + radius, y + height);\n            ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x, y + height, x, y + height - radius);\n            ctx.lineTo(x, y + radius);\n            ctx.quadraticCurveTo(x, y, x + radius, y);\n            ctx.closePath();\n        }\n\n        let time = 0;\n        function animate() {\n            // Fill background (matching new dark container)\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#050505';\n            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            time += 1;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {\n                const p = particles[i];\n\n                // Sine wave pulsing logic for alpha to simulate activity\n                const currentAlpha = p.alpha + Math.sin(time * p.pulseSpeed + p.timeOffset) * 0.3;\n                const clampedAlpha = Math.max(0.1, Math.min(1, currentAlpha));\n\n                ctx.globalAlpha = clampedAlpha;\n                ctx.fillStyle = p.baseColor;\n\n                // Draw cells as rounded squares\n                roundRect(ctx, p.x, p.y, config.cellSize, config.cellSize, 3);\n                ctx.fill();\n            }\n\n            ctx.globalAlpha = 1; // Reset alpha\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        resize();\n        animate();\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "synthetica-decoding-cognition-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/synthetica-decoding-cognition-1.jpg", "source_name": "synthetica-decoding-cognition-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 102, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T06:04:29.222636+00:00"}